ian obtained through this recruitment will <color=#ffbb00>definitely</color> be the featured 6-star Aurorian. Each time the featured 6-star Aurorian is obtained, the guarantee mechanism will be reset and recalculated.\n- Note: This collab exclusive recruitment's increased probability and guarantee mechanism are independent of other types of recruitments' increased probability and guarantee mechanisms. This collab exclusive recruitment's increased probability and guarantee mechanism are shared with the Traveling Alchemist recruitment but will not be carried over to the next collab exclusive recruitment.",
