  str_draw_card_pool_detail_sub_desc70006_1 = "This collab exclusive recruitment will be open for a limited time during the specified period. Special Star Flares and Collab 10× Recruitment Spirits can be used to recruit from this pool, which includes several limited-time collab exclusive Aurorians.\nThe exclusive Aurorians in this banner are the 6-Star Aurorian, <color=#ffbb00>Queen</color> and 5-Star Aurorian <color=#ffbb00>Fox</color>. When recruiting a 6-Star Aurorian, you'll have a <color=#ffbb00>50%</color> chance of recruiting Queen, and when recruiting a 5-Star Aurorian, you'll have a <color=#ffbb00>25%</color> chance of recruiting Fox. These Aurorians will not be obtainable from other recruitment banners.\n\nCollab exclusive recruitment rule details are as follows:\n\n- A 5-Star Aurorian is guaranteed within your first 10 recruitments.\n- The collab exclusive Aurorians <color=#ffbb00>Queen</color> and <color=#ffbb00>Fox</color> will only be available in the collab exclusive recruitment, Priestess and Emperor, and will not be added to the list of obtainable characters in other types of recruitment.\n- 6-Star Aurorian probability increase mechanism: The initial probability of obtaining a 6-Star Aurorian from this recruitment is <color=#ffbb00>2%</color>. If you fail to recruit a 6-Star Aurorian after <color=#ffbb00>50</color> recruitments in a row, the probability of obtaining a 6-Star Aurorian on your next recruitment attempt will increase from <color=#ffbb00>2%</color> to <color=#ffbb00>4.5%</color>. If you still fail to recruit a 6-Star Aurorian, the probability of obtaining a 6-Star Aurorian on your next recruitment attempt will increase from <color=#ffbb00>4.5%</color> to <color=#ffbb00>7%</color>, and so on. Whenever you fail to recruit a 6-Star Aurorian, the probability of obtaining a 6-Star Aurorian will increase by <color=#ffbb00>2.5%</color> until it reaches <color=#ffbb00>100%</color>. After obtaining a 6-Star Aurorian, the probability of obtaining a 6-Star Aurorian will be reset to <color=#ffbb00>2%</color>.\n- Guarantee mechanism: In the collab exclusive recruitment, if the 6-Star Aurorian featured in this recruitment is not obtained within <color=#ffbb00>2</color> consecutive attempts, then the next 6-Star Aurorian obtained through this recruitment will <color=#ffbb00>definitely</color> be the featured 6-Star Aurorian. Each time the featured 6-Star Aurorian is obtained, the guarantee mechanism will be reset and recalculated.\nNote: This collab exclusive recruitment's increased probability and guarantee mechanism are independent of other types of recruitments' increased probability and guarantee mechanisms. This collab exclusive recruitment's increased probability and guarantee mechanism are shared with the Fool and Faith recruitment but will not be carried over to the next collab exclusive recruitment.",
  str_draw_card_pool_detail_sub_desc70006_2 = [[
